# Data: FITS cutouts are GB-sized; keep them out of git and ship cache/ separately.
# The small frame lists and Gaia/CatWISE cones stay tracked so demo mode works from a fresh clone.
*.fits
*.fits.gz
cache/*
!cache/frames/
!cache/gaia/
!cache/wise/

